WEBVTT

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.350
I can't write it...

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:52.570
The Hydrangea Colored Picture-Letter

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:55.880
You don't know how to write a letter?

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:02.030
It's really hard for me to write this letter 
to Gauche to put in the letter bullet...

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.100
'Morning Niche.

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.050
Letters are one's heart itself.

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:09.020
You say that all the time, Lag.

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:12.290
I think all you have to do is to put 
your feelings into what you write.

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:16.420
But each time, I feel like saying more...

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:20.870
Then before I know it, I've lost 
what it is I really wanted to say...

00:02:20.870 --> 00:02:22.370
I wonder why?

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:24.250
Lag...

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.930
Have you not written that many letters?

00:02:29.340 --> 00:02:30.290
No...

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:32.000
Even though you're a Letter Bee?

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:33.450
Neither have I.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:34.830
On account of I am a dingo.

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.630
"On account?"

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:39.300
I've never written one either.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:43.090
I've done some to my family, but 
it was just perfunctory stuff.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:45.310
Sorry, I can't give you any advice.

00:02:46.870 --> 00:02:47.900
Hey!

00:02:47.900 --> 00:02:51.100
Connor, Zazie, why are you 
eating breakfast at my house?

00:02:51.100 --> 00:02:52.860
I'll pass on the soup, thanks.

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:53.770
What?!

00:02:56.450 --> 00:02:59.290
If I can use this letter bullet 
to resonate with Gauche's heart,

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:01.800
I may be able to call back his lost memories.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:10.200
I have to write a letter with all I've 
got for the next time I meet Gauche.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.910
Sylvette, don't cook my eggs so much.

00:03:12.070 --> 00:03:15.020
Sylvette, we're out of ham over here...

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:17.220
Shut up and eat some soup too!

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:28.730
I wonder how everyone writes their letters?

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.150
Wow, look at the giant mansion!

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:34.860
And all these gardens...

00:03:35.900 --> 00:03:38.590
Hello! Delivery for you!

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.130
Thank you for coming.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:45.120
Whoa, you're big!

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:49.600
I'm sorry...

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.750
Well, it's the truth, after all.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:56.210
Um, I came to deliver a 
Letter to a Ray Attlee.

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:04.650
It's quite impressive, but this mansion 
is a different style than Central...

00:04:04.650 --> 00:04:06.220
Mrs. Colbasso!

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:08.090
We have a guest!

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.320
Mrs. Colbasso, this here is...

00:04:13.170 --> 00:04:15.220
A Bee, yes?

00:04:15.220 --> 00:04:18.230
Yes! I came to deliver a 
letter to a Ray Attlee.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:22.080
And that person wishes to 
speak with you for a moment.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.270
With me?

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:26.030
Please, come up.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:31.260
Kimidori, that's enough.

00:04:31.260 --> 00:04:33.540
I will take the letter up.

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:34.650
Yes.

00:04:35.940 --> 00:04:38.630
Look at these filthy hands!

00:04:38.630 --> 00:04:40.420
I-I'm sorry...

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:41.670
I was, uh...

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:42.570
Enough!

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:43.500
Go back!

00:04:43.500 --> 00:04:44.900
I'm sorry!

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:51.780
A-Are you okay?

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.870
Don't worry 'bout me!

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:58.160
If there's one thing that's good 
about me, it's my sturdy body.

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.300
Hmph! The big oaf.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.280
Now, this way.

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:08.110
What was that noise?

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:10.750
A new maid tripped. That is all.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:11.870
Is she all right?

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.160
It is nothing out of the usual.

00:05:14.600 --> 00:05:16.330
Please come in.

00:05:17.190 --> 00:05:18.630
Pardon me.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.880
A boy?

00:05:23.410 --> 00:05:24.850
Watch your mouth!

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.280
How dare you address Mistress Ray like that!

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.950
M-Mistress?

00:05:29.950 --> 00:05:31.550
I-I'm sorry!

00:05:31.550 --> 00:05:32.810
I do not mind.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:37.900
Is it because I have often had to act 
as if I were a man since long ago.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:41.650
I am the mistress of this house, Ray Attlee.

00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:45.300
I only meant to say you look gallant.

00:05:45.300 --> 00:05:46.560
I apologize.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:50.660
I am Lag Seeing, and this is 
my dingo Niche with Steak.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.820
Now that I look at her, 
she's amazingly beautiful.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:02.290
Are these... hand drawn picture-letters?

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:06.050
They were delivered to me a little while ago.

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.470
However the sender's name 
or address was not written.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:13.260
They are simply addressed to "Mistress Ray".

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:16.560
Perhaps it was posted 
directly to the mansion.

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:19.120
There's no writing on them...

00:06:19.120 --> 00:06:22.120
Just pictures of hydrangea colored mountains.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:26.700
Those mountain pictures bring 
back many memories for me.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:35.100
When I was young, I lived in a small village in 
the north just like these pictures, named Medium.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:37.080
Perhaps that's why...

00:06:38.920 --> 00:06:40.900
After the Day of Flicker,

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:45.260
my mistress's parents were promoted to 
government positions in the capital.

00:06:45.260 --> 00:06:48.090
In concern for my mistress's health,

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:52.240
we moved to this mansion close to 
Central, with all its conveniences.

00:06:52.240 --> 00:06:56.320
I have suffered from chest 
pains ever since I was a child.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:59.060
It has gotten worse these 
past years, you see?

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:04.520
Lately, it is almost too 
painful to go on living...

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:13.130
But when I see these pictures, I remember 
my hometown, and it cheers my heart.

00:07:13.130 --> 00:07:14.490
Your heart?

00:07:15.050 --> 00:07:19.460
To me, these letters tell me 
to keep on fighting my illness.

00:07:20.020 --> 00:07:23.460
I wish there was some way I could thank 
the person who sent these pictures.

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:28.490
I tried searching myself, but 
I wasn't able to find much.

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:33.100
That's when I thought to ask 
a Bee -- a letter specialist.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:41.890
Lag Seeing, would you search for the person 
who sent this letter... who saved my life?

00:07:46.590 --> 00:07:48.530
What to do...

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:51.360
I couldn't say no after hearing all that.

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:55.190
And she even called me a letter specialist!

00:07:56.730 --> 00:07:59.160
She sure was a pretty lady.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:02.080
Anyway, where should we search?

00:08:02.080 --> 00:08:03.000
Lag!

00:08:04.570 --> 00:08:06.320
Why not shoot it with a Red Needle?

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.420
You could see who wrote it!

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.570
That's right!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:12.310
If I shoot my shindan into 
this picture-letter...

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:13.760
Good thinking, Niche!

00:08:14.690 --> 00:08:15.760
Okay...

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.130
I mustn't.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:23.880
It's one thing if it's 
an official lost letter,

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.260
but this one was delivered properly.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.990
I can't just go looking at its heart.

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:33.410
Since it was delivered directly, 
that's proof the sender lives nearby.

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:38.800
If there was only some hint in the letter...

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:39.770
Huh?

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.910
If I hold it up I can see a picture...

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:51.040
That's called a watermark.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:54.350
It shows the maker and 
the quality of the paper.

00:08:54.350 --> 00:08:58.430
So, do you know the person who 
bought the paper with this mark?

00:08:58.430 --> 00:09:02.490
That's the most popular product 
in my shop, the Howling Axolotls!

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:04.160
Everyone buys it!

00:09:04.160 --> 00:09:06.210
In fact, it's the standard worldwide!

00:09:08.680 --> 00:09:10.780
Fine. Next up, the paint supplies!

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.660
Nest of the paper flies?

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.570
I said: Next up, paint supplies.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:17.570
It's not any of the paints we mix here.

00:09:17.850 --> 00:09:20.890
I think it's handmade from flowers.

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:23.060
No luck here either?

00:09:23.060 --> 00:09:26.600
But this is quite a lovely hydrangea color...

00:09:26.600 --> 00:09:29.200
These might be Blue Romeo.

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.710
Blue Romeo.

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:34.210
It's a wildflower that's quite 
common in Northern Yuusari,

00:09:34.210 --> 00:09:36.970
and it's the base for a beautiful 
hydrangea color paint.

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.900
And where can I find some?

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:41.060
In this town? Nowhere.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:49.900
In the end we didn't get anywhere, Niche.

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:57.250
There really is a lot of 
foliage around this mansion.

00:09:57.750 --> 00:10:00.700
I wonder if there is a strain of spirit 
amber sleeping in the ground here?

00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:03.950
There's lots over there!

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:08.300
Niche! You mustn't go in 
there without permission!

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.880
He's that Letter Bee...

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:16.850
Niche!

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:20.500
What an impressive garden this is...

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:23.890
Is this what Mistress 
Ray's hometown was like?

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:29.440
You've traveled a long way, haven't you?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.030
Such a beautiful color...

00:10:31.030 --> 00:10:32.100
Thank you.

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:33.900
Miss Kimidori...

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:36.490
Niche!

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.190
What are you doing?

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:40.440
Nothing..

00:10:40.940 --> 00:10:43.230
Hydrangea-colored flowers...

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:45.830
Her fingers were stained 
with the same color...

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:48.750
You're the culprit!

00:10:52.870 --> 00:10:54.290
I did it!

00:10:58.600 --> 00:11:02.090
I see... So my mistress asked you...

00:11:02.840 --> 00:11:03.910
I'm sorry.

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:07.010
I didn't mean to say "culprit" like that.

00:11:07.010 --> 00:11:08.870
No, I'm sorry...

00:11:09.720 --> 00:11:13.440
But, you're the one who drew these, right?

00:11:13.710 --> 00:11:18.940
I wanted to cheer up my 
mistress, but I can't write.

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:25.240
I used to make paints to 
sell since I was little.

00:11:25.240 --> 00:11:29.170
And I would paint for my little 
brothers and sisters all the time...

00:11:29.500 --> 00:11:31.440
I'm pretty good at it.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:34.300
But then, why did you hide that it was you?

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:39.170
Mistress Ray said that those pictures gave 
her the courage to fight her illness.

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.720
R-Really?!

00:11:40.720 --> 00:11:41.550
Yes...

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:43.940
But... I'm not worthy!

00:11:43.940 --> 00:11:45.300
I'm not worthy!

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:47.640
Thank goodness... They helped...

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.640
Why don't you come forward?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:51.680
Mistress Ray said she wanted to reward you.

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.880
I don't care about no reward!

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.730
I just wanted to help her somehow.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:03.400
But I don't have any right 
to take claim for it.

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:04.740
Right?

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:09.850
The Blue Romeo flowers you used for the 
paint are only from the north, right?

00:12:10.640 --> 00:12:14.370
Do you have some connection with 
Mistress Ray's hometown up north?

00:12:16.850 --> 00:12:17.970
I'm sorry.

00:12:17.970 --> 00:12:19.810
I guess you have your reasons.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.790
Please don't tell her.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.970
Please don't tell her, Mr. Letter Bee!

00:12:25.970 --> 00:12:29.020
Don't tell about this, no matter what!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:31.000
I wunderstand!

00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:35.010
Since you winsist, I won't say a thwing!

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.550
I pwomise.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:39.490
Thank you! You promised!

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:43.940
But, what should I tell her?

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:47.090
It'll be hard for me to disappoint her.

00:12:48.100 --> 00:12:50.950
Mr. Lag Seeing is here to see you.

00:12:52.240 --> 00:12:53.840
Pardon me.

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:56.170
Lag! What took you so long?

00:12:57.610 --> 00:13:01.890
I just heard everything about the 
picture letter from Colbasso.

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.440
You did?

00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:05.800
But I thought she wanted 
to keep it a secret...

00:13:07.210 --> 00:13:10.100
I see you wanted to keep it 
a secret from me, Colbasso.

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:15.850
Since you found out about it, it 
seems she decided to confess to me.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:17.850
She did?

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:24.110
Colbasso used flowers from my hometown to 
make paints and drew those picture letters!

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:28.190
My beloved hydrangea color...

00:13:28.190 --> 00:13:30.290
That's why it brought back so many memories.

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:33.600
I'm so shocked that you'd go 
to such lengths, Colbasso...

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:39.120
I do everything I can to serve you, Mistress.

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:42.700
Colbasso, is there something you wish for?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.830
If it's something I can do, just ask.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:46.990
Oh, I couldn't!

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:51.020
Well, perhaps one little thing...

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:53.400
Anything you say...

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:58.690
I would like to own all this fertile 
land here in Yuusari Central.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:01.010
All the land here?!

00:14:01.010 --> 00:14:02.400
So greedy!

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:04.450
Um, Mistress Ray...

00:14:04.450 --> 00:14:05.610
What is it, Lag?

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.450
P-Please don't tell her!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:15.080
No need to worry. That 
brat won't say anything.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.000
I can't say...

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:19.810
I promised Miss Kimidori...

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:22.750
Lag?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:25.920
I can't say it...

00:14:26.530 --> 00:14:27.610
But...

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:34.680
I never promised not to shoot a shindan!

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:36.520
What are you...

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:41.900
Deliver the true heart contained within 
this picture-letter to Mistress Ray!

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:44.910
Red Needle!

00:14:51.070 --> 00:14:53.040
Mistress!

00:14:53.040 --> 00:14:54.770
Mistress Ray!

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:56.970
We are ready for her to be 
changed, but where is she?

00:14:56.970 --> 00:15:00.240
And we are leaving tomorrow for Central!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:04.060
Mistress!

00:15:05.090 --> 00:15:06.840
Mistress!

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:11.170
Mistress!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.290
Is this your house?

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:19.020
This is a workshop.

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:22.300
I make paint using the flowers.

00:15:22.300 --> 00:15:24.040
This becomes green.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.740
And these become a really 
great hydrangea color.

00:15:27.740 --> 00:15:29.210
Hydrangea color?

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:33.600
That's my favorite color of them all.

00:15:34.180 --> 00:15:35.910
Same as me!

00:15:35.910 --> 00:15:38.440
Hey, can I help you?

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.170
You'll get your hands dirty...

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.620
I don't mind.

00:15:43.800 --> 00:15:45.880
Oh? You're good at this.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:46.900
Really?

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.950
I'd better not get shown up by you!

00:15:53.010 --> 00:15:56.690
Mistress, I know you are in there.

00:15:57.650 --> 00:15:59.740
Colbasso found me, huh?

00:15:59.740 --> 00:16:03.350
If I don't return, my 
servants could be fired.

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:06.630
I'm Ray. And you?

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:08.610
K-Kimidori.

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:12.200
I've never had such fun.

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:15.200
This is a great memory 
I made of this village.

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:18.030
I wish there were some way to repay you.

00:16:18.300 --> 00:16:19.880
Oh, that's not...

00:16:19.880 --> 00:16:20.620
I know!

00:16:22.440 --> 00:16:27.500
Take one of my two hair pins, Kimidori.

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.030
As proof we're hometown friends...

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:39.000
Proof we're hometown friends...

00:16:41.050 --> 00:16:42.420
Sis!

00:16:42.420 --> 00:16:43.900
Big Sis!

00:16:43.900 --> 00:16:45.890
Stop this, you brutes!

00:16:45.890 --> 00:16:48.930
None 'o this woulda happened 
if you'd just paid up.

00:16:48.930 --> 00:16:53.150
But you don't even got 
anything we could sell!

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:57.570
Ow!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:03.140
Amazing...

00:17:03.140 --> 00:17:05.500
This is actual lion silver!

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.630
You could pay back the money 
you owe and more with this!

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:13.000
So? You want to sell it for cash?

00:17:15.470 --> 00:17:16.350
Okay...

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:21.010
I expect a high price for it.

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:23.520
Kimidori?

00:17:25.220 --> 00:17:27.550
You guys are grown up now.

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:30.140
Take care of Mom and Dad.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:32.300
Are you really going, Sis?

00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:34.800
Where's this Central place?

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.270
You got somewhere to live?

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.370
Why are you goin'?

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:44.540
I got no right to be her friend, 
but I gotta do something for her.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:50.710
For Mistress Ray, I have to do something!

00:18:17.150 --> 00:18:21.080
I love hydrangea color the 
most of all the colors.

00:18:22.470 --> 00:18:23.870
Mistress!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.200
Kimidori...

00:18:27.190 --> 00:18:32.380
The color in those picture-letters of the 
scenery is a past I'd started to forget...

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:38.880
This is the first time 
I've ever been so happy.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:45.970
My hometown and friend... were both 
delivered to me at the same time...

00:18:50.330 --> 00:18:52.250
A picture-letter, huh?

00:18:52.650 --> 00:18:55.940
That's another way for letters to 
contain people's hearts, isn't it?

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:00.250
Okay! I'll draw a picture 
for Gauche's letter, too!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.080
Lag.

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:09.090
What is this?

00:19:09.090 --> 00:19:10.270
Gauche!

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.460
I can't draw, Niche!

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:17.150
No way I can do what Miss Kimidori did...

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:23.290
Hmph! Just you remember 
this, you damn Letter Bee!

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:41.250
Next: Wilderness Imagery Lighthouse
